WEBVTT

00:46:28.561 --> 00:46:31.712
And the idea of being able
to see things from both sides

00:46:31.736 --> 00:46:33.252
and come together,

00:46:33.276 --> 00:46:37.283
is, in this time and through history,

00:46:37.307 --> 00:46:40.228
perceived as almost being weak

00:46:40.252 --> 00:46:42.228
or a threat.

00:46:42.641 --> 00:46:46.371
Because you've got to get
on one side or the other side

00:46:46.395 --> 00:46:47.554
and so on.

00:46:47.578 --> 00:46:52.518
And so it's not easy to just say --

00:46:52.542 --> 00:46:56.601
Like, all the people,
and China for example, I would say,

00:46:56.625 --> 00:46:57.831
"Thank you very much,"

00:46:57.855 --> 00:47:02.095
you know how many respirators
and masks and all these things